on 原語)。workload scheduler ではない。\", :kotoba-fleet \"coding-agent 協調の lease/governor 基盤。workload hosting ではない (murakumo `fleet` view が消費)。\"}}", :adr/date "2026-07-07", :db/id -1, :adr/known-gaps "[{:gap \"fleet 横断の単一 lattice auction (cross-node peering) 未配線\", :owner-adr \"2606271600\"} {:gap \"reconcile→実行が propose-only (承認 gate 後の実 GPU/node 起動 API 未実装)\", :owner-adr \"2607031600\"} {:gap \"fleet レベル self-healing 未達 (動的 join/leave・自動再分割なし。kernel panic は物理電源が必要だった実測)\", :owner-adr \"2607022000\"} {:gap \"kekkai membership / net gossip / overlay 統合は proposed\", :owner-adr \"2607023100\"} {:gap \"RBAC / admission control / HPA / health-gated progressive rollout は意図的に非対応 (必要時に個別 ADR)\", :owner-adr nil}]", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "murakumo ファミリー = k8s / wasmCloud+wadm 相当ポジション — 分散 hosting・control-plane 層の明文化"}]